OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into British man's
OL,4,Adeath in Sicily
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a British man whose body
OL,7,Fwas found in Sicily is being
OL,8,Finvestigated, the Italian authorities
OL,9,Fhave confirmed.
OL,11,FBenjamin John Braithwaite, 35, from
OL,12,FLeeds, was found dead at about 03:00
OL,13,FBST local time on Sunday near Noto in
OL,14,Fthe Province of Syracuse, a
OL,15,Fspokesperson for the Italian police,
OL,16,Fthe Carabinieri, said.
OL,18,FThe spokesperson confirmed a rope was
OL,19,Ffound nearby, while the presence of
OL,20,Finjuries or signs of violence,
OL,21,Fincluding possible injuries to the
OL,22,Fneck, remained under investigation.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
