OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into British man's
OL,4,Adeath in Sicily
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Foreign, Commonwealth and
OL,7,FDevelopment Office spokesperson said:
OL,8,F"We are supporting the family of a
OL,9,FBritish man who died in Italy and are
OL,10,Fin touch with the local authorities."
